title: $:/mf/gen/CLI command/mf ignore set
catalog: CLI command
target: mf ignore set
summary: Replace the target's whole mf_ignore set with the presets' patterns (with no preset, clears the set)

!! Reference

```
Replace the target's whole mf_ignore set with the presets' patterns (with no preset, clears the set)

Usage: mf ignore set [OPTIONS] [PRESETS]...

Arguments:
  [PRESETS]...
          Preset names (comma- or space-separated), e.g. `rust-build,node`. May be empty for `set` (which then clears the target's mf_ignore)

Options:
  -d, --dir <PATH>
          Target directory (default: the repository root)

  -h, --help
          Print help
```
